z(x) in Algorithm 1: z(x) = sqrt(2/D) \link[=cos(w_1^T x + b_1), ...,
cos(w_D^T x + b_D)]{cos(w_1^T x + b_1), ..., cos(w_D^T x + b_D)}^T, with w_1, ..., w_D drawn from p(w), the Fourier
transform of the kernel, and b_1, ..., b_D drawn from Uniform(0, 2 pi).  The
